<title>USA: Lindberg stake raised by Miami investor.</title>
<headline>Lindberg stake raised by Miami investor.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Miami investor Ira Sochet on Wednesday said he raised his stake in Lindberg Corp to 494,700 common shares, or 10.4 percent of the total.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, Sochet said his latest transactions include the purchase of 26,000 common shares between February 11 and February 25 at prices ranging from $8.5625 to $9.125 each.</p>
<p>Lindberg, based in Des Plaines, Ill., provides commercial heat-treating services to metal-working industries.</p>
